{"4625610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Plumber Simulator", "steam_appid": 4625610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Plumber Simulator</strong>, you step into the boots of a plumber running a modest business of his own. No dirty job is too much for you, and only you can save every home from flooding when the city’s aging sewer system starts to fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One phone call and you are always on site — ready to handle any breakdown, although sometimes you might be tempted to fix it on the cheap… Well, you’ve got to have that business instinct after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/cd0a210f9bbe27cca1be276f02f197fe.webp?t=1782297754\" width=800 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city’s sewer network is outdated, and almost every day another pipe begins to leak, or even bursts under the pressure. It’s up to you to locate the source of the problem and stop the water flow as quickly as possible before the entire house gets flooded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/be0d69d30a3d0afc01885f6b76838e00.poster.avif?t=1782297754\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/be0d69d30a3d0afc01885f6b76838e00.webm?t=1782297754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/be0d69d30a3d0afc01885f6b76838e00.mp4?t=1782297754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/8f8e1a6089916d2ee54c85dc16a7f141.webp?t=1782297754\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every installation is made up of small parts that you can inspect up close. Using the right tools, you will be able to dismantle and disconnect them, remove faulty components, and decide what should replace the damaged parts of the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/b3e7eae3e296fa35dc76eda4723b7fc4.poster.avif?t=1782297754\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/b3e7eae3e296fa35dc76eda4723b7fc4.webm?t=1782297754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/b3e7eae3e296fa35dc76eda4723b7fc4.mp4?t=1782297754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/6ccf27d8f19793b37755f2dd7fade324.webp?t=1782297754\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copper, steel, or plastic? The choice of pipe is yours, and each type requires a different approach and specialized tools. Old steel pipes need sealing and tightening, copper ones call for a torch, and plastic pipes are glued together or joined with a heat welder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/1a39796eb9fa564c394ed4ce05ab5fec.poster.avif?t=1782297754\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/1a39796eb9fa564c394ed4ce05ab5fec.webm?t=1782297754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/1a39796eb9fa564c394ed4ce05ab5fec.mp4?t=1782297754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/f1b1f811a369a1c9e56e798fcebf4cbf.webp?t=1782297754\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designing and installing a pipe network is no easy task. To create a clean and efficient system, you’ll first need to measure the space and then choose the correct pipe dimensions. Various fittings, valves, and tools will help you guide the flow exactly where it needs to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/ce92428a8755aa42d46208722b77386b.poster.avif?t=1782297754\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/ce92428a8755aa42d46208722b77386b.webm?t=1782297754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/ce92428a8755aa42d46208722b77386b.mp4?t=1782297754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/1c1c84d236350f037b05b03117efc1cf.webp?t=1782297754\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you’ve renovated their bathroom, clients may even trust you with the interior design. Choose the right fixtures and arrange their home oasis of comfort while staying within the proposed budget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/3cdf3c1ec2905120b6d8765464a4ad78.poster.avif?t=1782297754\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/3cdf3c1ec2905120b6d8765464a4ad78.webm?t=1782297754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/3cdf3c1ec2905120b6d8765464a4ad78.mp4?t=1782297754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The job may be dirty, but the money you earn certainly won’t be.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Plumber Simulator</strong>, you step into the boots of a plumber running a modest business of his own. No dirty job is too much for you, and only you can save every home from flooding when the city’s aging sewer system starts to fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One phone call and you are always on site — ready to handle any breakdown, although sometimes you might be tempted to fix it on the cheap… Well, you’ve got to have that business instinct after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/cd0a210f9bbe27cca1be276f02f197fe.webp?t=1782297754\" width=800 height=50 