the space and then choose the correct pipe dimensions. Various fittings, valves, and tools will help you guide the flow exactly where it needs to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/ce92428a8755aa42d46208722b77386b.poster.avif?t=1782297754\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/ce92428a8755aa42d46208722b77386b.webm?t=1782297754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/ce92428a8755aa42d46208722b77386b.mp4?t=1782297754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/1c1c84d236350f037b05b03117efc1cf.webp?t=1782297754\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you’ve renovated their bathroom, clients may even trust you with the interior design. Choose the right fixtures and arrange their home oasis of comfort while staying within the proposed budget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/3cdf3c1ec2905120b6d8765464a4ad78.poster.avif?t=1782297754\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/3cdf3c1ec2905120b6d8765464a4ad78.webm?t=1782297754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4625610/extras/3cdf3c1ec2905120b6d8765464a4ad78.m